# Production build settings for the CyberRange "Compliance Portal" lab.
#
# The frontend and the Express API are served from the SAME origin and port
# inside the lab container, so the browser must call the API with a relative
# base ("/api"). Vite reads this file automatically during `npm run build`
# (and `docker build` sets the same value via ENV), so a plain `npm run build`
# always produces a correctly-wired bundle with no extra flags.
#
# Do NOT put a host or port here — that would hard-code this machine into the
# bundle and break the lab anywhere else.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
